# Hallow's Eve progression: Old Jack's questline, dailies, board and shop, his conversation, the
# Gravekeeper's conversation and the trick-or-treat line, the season's achievements and titles, its
# two reputations (Old Jack's Favor and the Hallowed, id Hallows_Eve_Hallowed) and its Almanac page.
# Keys are written bare: the library finds each one by its tail, whatever this file is called.
# Numbers ride {0} and come from the content files, so a retune never touches a translation.

# ---- The wallet ----
currency.hallows_eve_sweets.name = Hallow Sweets
currency.hallows_eve_sweets.amount = {0, number} {0, plural, one {Hallow Sweet} other {Hallow Sweets}}
currency.hallows_eve_sweets.description = Spend them at Old Jack's shop in the Forgotten Temple.

# ---- Old Jack's questline ----
quest.category.hallows_eve = Hallow's Eve
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_meet.title = Lanterns in the Temple
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_meet.flavor = It's the season again, so I'm back in the Forgotten Temple with my lanterns. Any Forgotten Temple Gateway will get you there. Come and find me. I could use a hand.
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_1.title = Pumpkin Patch
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_1.flavor = My lanterns are carved from Hallowed Pumpkins, and I'm running low. Pick pumpkins by hand and bring me the cold, glowing ones.
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_2.title = Lantern Work
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_2.flavor = A pumpkin packed with powder keeps the dead back better than any lantern. Throw a few Lantern Bombs, then tell me how they burned.
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_3.title = Ghouls on the Steps
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_3.flavor = My lanterns keep the ghouls off the steps, but only just. Put a few Hollow Ghouls back in the ground after dark.
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_4.title = Ectoplasm Run
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_4.flavor = Ectoplasm is what burns in my lanterns, and a Lost Soul leaves some behind when it's set free. Free a few and bring it to me.
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_5.title = Cursed Stone
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_5.flavor = Stone gives up Cursed Geodes this time of year, if you break enough of it. Crack a few open and keep whatever falls out.
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_lantern.title = The Hollow Lantern
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_lantern.flavor = I've got the Horseman's ember. Now your Hollow Lantern wants a Hallowed Pumpkin, some Ectoplasm, and the skeletons wearing my face knocked flat.
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_horseman.title = The Rider
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_horseman.flavor = The Gravekeeper beside me knows the way into the Horseman's graveyard, but he won't open the gate without a Grave Candle, and I sell those at my shop once I count you a Regular. Buy one, go in with friends and knock him out of the saddle.
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_horseman_hard.title = Fire for the Lantern
quest.hallows_eve_old_jack_horseman_hard.flavor = Your lantern wants a flame that won't go out, and the Horseman carries one. Ask the Gravekeeper for the hard ride, beat him, and bring me his ember.

# ---- Old Jack's dailies ----
quest.hallows_eve_jack_daily_souls.title = Restless Souls
quest.hallows_eve_jack_daily_souls.flavor = More Lost Souls drifted in last night. Set some free before they settle in for good.
quest.hallows_eve_jack_daily_pumpkins.title = Pumpkin Rounds
quest.hallows_eve_jack_daily_pumpkins.flavor = The lanterns burn through Hallowed Pumpkins faster than I can carve them. Bring me a few more before dark.
quest.hallows_eve_jack_daily_geodes.title = Geodes for Jack
quest.hallows_eve_jack_daily_geodes.flavor = Crack a couple of Cursed Geodes for me. My hands are too stiff for it these days.

