lootable.hallows_eve_meet_pay.flavor = A few sweets to say hello.
lootable.hallows_eve_chain_pay.title = Old Jack's Pay
lootable.hallows_eve_chain_pay.flavor = What Old Jack pays for each job he gives you.
lootable.hallows_eve_daily_pay.title = Old Jack's Daily Pay
lootable.hallows_eve_daily_pay.flavor = What Old Jack pays for a day's work.
lootable.hallows_eve_lantern_pay.title = Old Jack's Thanks
lootable.hallows_eve_lantern_pay.flavor = What Old Jack gives each year for lighting the Hollow Lantern.
lootable.hallows_eve_board_pay.title = Old Jack's Extras
lootable.hallows_eve_board_pay.flavor = A bit extra on top of what the job pays, for anyone who works my board.
lootable.hallows_eve_board_sweets.title = The Candy Jar
lootable.hallows_eve_board_sweets.flavor = However many I can grab in one hand.
lootable.hallows_eve_hallowed_cache.title = Hallowed Cache
lootable.hallows_eve_hallowed_cache.flavor = The Hallowed leave this for you each time you climb another step past Exalted with them. Don't ask me where they get it.
lootable.hallows_eve_trick_or_treat.title = Trick or Treat
lootable.hallows_eve_trick_or_treat.flavor = Knock and see what you get. Treats, mostly.
lootable.hallows_eve_treats.title = Something Sweet
lootable.hallows_eve_treats.flavor = What you get when the trick won't take.
lootable.hallows_eve_geode_crack.title = Cracked Geode
lootable.hallows_eve_geode_crack.flavor = Whatever falls out of a Cursed Geode when you crack it. Crystal every time, and better when you're lucky.

