# ---- Old Jack's board ----
board.hallows_eve_daily.title = Old Jack's Board
board.hallows_eve_daily.desc = Work for the dark and work for the daylight. My regulars get a bit more. Collect your pay before I pack up. Miss me, and what you've earned still waits in your Objective Book.
board.hallows_eve_daily.grade.night = Night Work
board.hallows_eve_daily.grade.day = Day Work
quest.hallows_eve_board_souls.title = Soul Sweep
quest.hallows_eve_board_souls.flavor = Souls are thick around the temple tonight. Set a good many of them free before morning.
quest.hallows_eve_board_ghouls.title = Ghoul Cull
quest.hallows_eve_board_ghouls.flavor = The graves are busy tonight. Put the Hollow Ghouls back where they came from, and don't be gentle about it.
quest.hallows_eve_board_bombs.title = Lantern Barrage
quest.hallows_eve_board_bombs.flavor = Burn through a stack of Lantern Bombs for me. I don't much care what at, as long as it isn't the temple.
quest.hallows_eve_board_geodes.title = Deep Geodes
quest.hallows_eve_board_geodes.flavor = Cursed Geodes are turning up in the stone again, the ore most of all. Crack some open for me, and mind your fingers.
quest.hallows_eve_board_harvest_moon.title = Harvest Moon Hunt
quest.hallows_eve_board_harvest_moon.flavor = The Harvest Moon is up and the Jack Skeletons are out in numbers. Knock a good few down before it sets.
quest.hallows_eve_board_wraiths.title = Mineshaft Wraiths
quest.hallows_eve_board_wraiths.flavor = Something with a scythe walks the mineshafts after dark, down where the torches don't reach. Put a few of them down for me.
quest.hallows_eve_board_ectoplasm.title = Lantern Fuel
quest.hallows_eve_board_ectoplasm.flavor = My lanterns are running low on Ectoplasm. The Lost Souls leave it behind when you set them free, so bring me a good lot of it.
quest.hallows_eve_board_pumpkins.title = Cold Pumpkins
quest.hallows_eve_board_pumpkins.flavor = The lanterns want more Hallowed Pumpkins than I can find on my own. Pick pumpkins by hand and bring me the cold ones.
quest.hallows_eve_board_carving.title = Bench Carving
quest.hallows_eve_board_carving.flavor = Every doorstep wants a lantern, and I can only carve so fast. Carve some Jack Lanterns at a Carving Bench, a pumpkin and a bit of charcoal apiece.
quest.hallows_eve_board_skeletons.title = Rattling Bones
quest.hallows_eve_board_skeletons.flavor = The skeletons wearing my face are out after dark again, rattling about wherever the torches don't reach. Knock a good few of them flat for me.
quest.hallows_eve_board_fiends.title = Weeding the Patch
quest.hallows_eve_board_fiends.flavor = Pumpkin Fiends are crawling about the autumn woods after dark, where the wild pumpkins grow. Squash a good few of them for me before they take root.

# ---- Old Jack's errands board ----
board.hallows_eve_errands.title = Old Jack's Errands
board.hallows_eve_errands.desc = Odd jobs, one for the dark and one for the daylight. I pin up a fresh pair every few hours, so check back.
board.hallows_eve_errands.pill = Errand
quest.hallows_eve_errand_souls.title = Stray Souls
quest.hallows_eve_errand_souls.flavor = A few Lost Souls have drifted in since I last looked. Set them free when you get a minute.
quest.hallows_eve_errand_ghouls.title = Grave Watch
quest.hallows_eve_errand_ghouls.flavor = Some Hollow Ghouls are pawing at the graves again. Put them back down before they wander off.
quest.hallows_eve_errand_skeletons.title = Loose Bones
quest.hallows_eve_errand_skeletons.flavor = A few Jack Skeletons got loose last night. Knock them down when you're out after dark.
quest.hallows_eve_errand_fiends.title = Bad Seeds
quest.hallows_eve_errand_fiends.flavor = A few Pumpkin Fiends have sprouted in the autumn woods. Squash them when you're out after dark.
quest.hallows_eve_errand_ectoplasm.title = Guttering Lantern
quest.hallows_eve_errand_ectoplasm.flavor = One of my lanterns is guttering. A little Ectoplasm would see it through the night.
quest.hallows_eve_errand_bombs.title = Bomb Practice
quest.hallows_eve_errand_bombs.flavor = Got some Lantern Bombs going spare? Throw a few for me. I like the noise.
quest.hallows_eve_errand_geodes.title = Cracked Stone
quest.hallows_eve_errand_geodes.flavor = Crack some Cursed Geodes open while you're out. Somebody has to.
quest.hallows_eve_errand_pumpkins.title = Spare Pumpkins
quest.hallows_eve_errand_pumpkins.flavor = A lantern's gone soft on the steps. Bring me some Hallowed Pumpkins when you're passing.

# ---- Old Jack's shop ----
shop.hallows_eve_old_jack.title = Old Jack's Shop
shop.hallows_eve_old_jack.desc = Lantern Bombs, lanterns and a few odd things for the season.
shop.hallows_eve_old_jack.category.bombs = Lantern Bombs
shop.hallows_eve_old_jack.category.lights = Lanterns
shop.hallows_eve_old_jack.category.gear = Gear
shop.hallows_eve_offer_harvest_moon_bundle.title = Harvest Moon Bundle
shop.hallows_eve_offer_harvest_moon_bundle.desc = Shattering and Spectral Lantern Bombs, sold only while the Harvest Moon is up.
shop.hallows_eve_offer_spyglass.desc = Look through it in the Guttering Hollows to pinpoint the location of a Voidtaken beast.
shop.hallows_eve_offer_sell_eternal_candle.title = Sell a Spare Eternal Candle
shop.hallows_eve_offer_sell_eternal_candle.desc = One Eternal Candle is all you need to open the Horseman's graveyard. Bring Old Jack a spare and he'll pay you for it.

